invariant: INV-62
file: src/mldsa_sign_steps.c
catches: mldsa_signer_test_host
reason: a host object's round reads NTT(t0[0]) for every row of the
  hints, so its c t0 is wrong in seven rows of eight. The signature
  differs from the device frame's and from the test signer's, and
  bin/mldsa_signer_test_host compares it with both.

--- old
        return &st->ex->key.t0_hat[i];
--- new
        return &st->ex->key.t0_hat[0];
